- The research record separates observed evidence from interpretation and
  preserves negative/null outcomes that affect the conclusion.
- The declared scope contains no unresolved placeholder implementation or
  undocumented workaround required for this objective to function.
- Evidence is durable enough to move this TODO to `todo/completed/` and remove
